'''Houndoom''' (Japanese: '''ヘルガー''' ''Hellgar'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

