==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Houndoom|H11}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*'''Corner''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Destiny|Houndour|43}} from the {{TCG|Neo Destiny}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

